 "fix": "APPLIED in the firmware (config.h JAW_FLOOR_BELOW_C0_DEG 4.9; controls.md 6.4): the jaw floor theta_c0 - 4.9 deg is a position bound the squeeze cannot pass whether or not the trip fires, so the peak is the smaller of the trip peak and the force at the floor (T09P-floor49, same floor samples as T09F-relfloor8). No trip setting does it alone: the only trip that passes by itself, F_TRIP_N 5.5 with F_TRIP_MS 10 (T09P-trip55), sits inside the hold band and falsely trips grips, as F_TRIP_N 7.0 did (T09P-trip7, declined: 10 of 17 window grips, 34 of 1,000 drawn grips).",
